xref: PS:Description "There are three major classes of intracellular RNA-degrading enzymes (ribonucleases or RNases) including endonucleases, 5' exonucleases, and 3' exonucleases that degrade RNA from the 3' end. Pathway is built manually using published studies."
synonym: "Description: There are three major classes of intracellular RNA-degrading enzymes (ribonucleases or RNases) including endonucleases, 5' exonucleases, and 3' exonucleases that degrade RNA from the 3' end. Pathway is built manually using published studies." EXACT []
