xref: PS:Description "Transcription is the process in which a DNA sequence is enzymatically processed to produce a complementary RNA. Pathway is built manually using published studies."
synonym: "Description: Transcription is the process in which a DNA sequence is enzymatically processed to produce a complementary RNA. Pathway is built manually using published studies." EXACT []
