is_a: urn:agi-folder:chromosome ! Chromosome
is_a: urn:agi-folder:k ! K
xref: PS:Description "Kinetochores are unique protein complexes assembled onto the single centromere DNA region of each sister chromatid during mitosis. Pathway is built manually using published studies."
synonym: "Description: Kinetochores are unique protein complexes assembled onto the single centromere DNA region of each sister chromatid during mitosis. Pathway is built manually using published studies." EXACT []
