xref: PS:Notes "While there is evidence that DNA damage eventually leads to mTORC1 inhibition through p53-dependent mechanisms, there are also evidences that mTORC1 is activated following DNA damage. mTORC1 regulates the DNA damage response through the upregulation of FANCD2 gene expression, a key protein involved in the repair of DNA double-strand breaks."
synonym: "Notes: While there is evidence that DNA damage eventually leads to mTORC1 inhibition through p53-dependent mechanisms, there are also evidences that mTORC1 is activated following DNA damage. mTORC1 regulates the DNA damage response through the upregulation of FANCD2 gene expression, a key protein involved in the repair of DNA double-strand breaks." EXACT []

