xref: PS:Description "Tangier disease (E78.6) is a rare, inherited disorder characterized by significantly reduced levels of high-density lipoprotein (HDL) in the blood. Pathway is built manually using published studies."
synonym: "Description: Tangier disease (E78.6) is a rare, inherited disorder characterized by significantly reduced levels of high-density lipoprotein (HDL) in the blood. Pathway is built manually using published studies." EXACT []
