xref: PS:Notes "Headnote: Polymorphisms/mutations in several circadian clock genes (PER2, PER3, CLOCK) and their regulator CSNK1D were associated with sleep disturbances.     Signaling description: PER2 gene mutation was found to cause advanced sleep phase disorder. PER3 genotype was shown to contribute variance in predicting insomnia severity in alcoholic desease patients. CLOCK gene polymorphisms probably plays role in depression-associated insomnia. CLOCK genotype was shown to influences the time course of insomnia during antidepressant treatment. Casein kinase I isoform delta (CSNK1D) mutation is associated with familial advanced sleep phase syndrome."
synonym: "Notes: Headnote: Polymorphisms/mutations in several circadian clock genes (PER2, PER3, CLOCK) and their regulator CSNK1D were associated with sleep disturbances.     Signaling description: PER2 gene mutation was found to cause advanced sleep phase disorder. PER3 genotype was shown to contribute variance in predicting insomnia severity in alcoholic desease patients. CLOCK gene polymorphisms probably plays role in depression-associated insomnia. CLOCK genotype was shown to influences the time course of insomnia during antidepressant treatment. Casein kinase I isoform delta (CSNK1D) mutation is associated with familial advanced sleep phase syndrome." EXACT []

