xref: PS:Notes "Headnote: Muscular dystrophy refers to a group of progressive muscular disorders with muscle weakening and breakdown being the major symptom.    Signaling description: Insulin growth factor 1 (IGF1) and myostatin (MSTN) are important regulators of muscle size. IGF1 stimulates muscle hypertrophy, while MSTN represses hypertrophy and induces atrophy. IGF1 and MSTN signaling pathways interact with each other. MSTN decreases the phosphorylation of AKT1, which occurs as a result of IGF1 action. It can also increase the activity of FOXO, a factor that is repressed by IGF1/AKT1 signaling.    Outcome effects: The inhibition of AKT1 and activation of FOXO lead to a blockade of IGF1 action, prevention of myogenesis, and activation of atrophy. In turn, IGF1/AKT1 signaling represses FOXO thereby preventing some of the MSTN effects. The balance between IGF1 and MSTN signaling is important for muscle size determination.    Highlighted proteins: Proteins with decreased expression or activity are highlighted in blue."
synonym: "Notes: Headnote: Muscular dystrophy refers to a group of progressive muscular disorders with muscle weakening and breakdown being the major symptom.    Signaling description: Insulin growth factor 1 (IGF1) and myostatin (MSTN) are important regulators of muscle size. IGF1 stimulates muscle hypertrophy, while MSTN represses hypertrophy and induces atrophy. IGF1 and MSTN signaling pathways interact with each other. MSTN decreases the phosphorylation of AKT1, which occurs as a result of IGF1 action. It can also increase the activity of FOXO, a factor that is repressed by IGF1/AKT1 signaling.    Outcome effects: The inhibition of AKT1 and activation of FOXO lead to a blockade of IGF1 action, prevention of myogenesis, and activation of atrophy. In turn, IGF1/AKT1 signaling represses FOXO thereby preventing some of the MSTN effects. The balance between IGF1 and MSTN signaling is important for muscle size determination.    Highlighted proteins: Proteins with decreased expression or activity are highlighted in blue." EXACT []

