xref: PS:Notes "TLR3 signaling was shown to play controversial role in retinal pigment epithelium cells (RPE). In the one hand, TLR3 activation by double-stranded RNA may activate caspase-3-mediated apoptotic death in RPE via IRF3 and probably IRF7. In the other hand, activation of TLR3 by poly(I:C) protects RPE from oxidative stress and cell death."
synonym: "Notes: TLR3 signaling was shown to play controversial role in retinal pigment epithelium cells (RPE). In the one hand, TLR3 activation by double-stranded RNA may activate caspase-3-mediated apoptotic death in RPE via IRF3 and probably IRF7. In the other hand, activation of TLR3 by poly(I:C) protects RPE from oxidative stress and cell death." EXACT []

