xref: PS:Notes "Headnote: Endoplasmic-Reticulum (ER) stress is a potent inducer of apoptosis and VEGFA expression in retinal pigment epithelium (RPE) cells.     Signaling description: Oxidized LDL and homocysteine can activate VEGFA expression via EIF2AK3/ATF4 signaling and in that way trigger neovascularization. 7-Ketocholesterol induces ERN1 signaling and activates caspase-8 (CASP8) and caspase-12 (CASP12). Epidemiological studies have revealed that smoking is a strong risk factor for AMD. Cigarette smoke, which contains benzopyrene, is a potent inducer of ER stress via the EIF2AK3 pathway. Benzopyrene can increase the activity of multiple caspases, including, caspase-3, caspase-9 and caspase-12 in human RPE cells.During ER stress, activated EIF2AK3 phosphorylates EIF2S1, which in turn contributes to the activation of nuclear factor kB (NF-kB), a potent transcriptional factor that regulates angiogenesis and inflammation in proliferative retinal diseases. Increasing levels of inflammatory mediators, such as IL6 and IL8 were been found in the retinas from patients with neovascularisation."
synonym: "Notes: Headnote: Endoplasmic-Reticulum (ER) stress is a potent inducer of apoptosis and VEGFA expression in retinal pigment epithelium (RPE) cells.     Signaling description: Oxidized LDL and homocysteine can activate VEGFA expression via EIF2AK3/ATF4 signaling and in that way trigger neovascularization. 7-Ketocholesterol induces ERN1 signaling and activates caspase-8 (CASP8) and caspase-12 (CASP12). Epidemiological studies have revealed that smoking is a strong risk factor for AMD. Cigarette smoke, which contains benzopyrene, is a potent inducer of ER stress via the EIF2AK3 pathway. Benzopyrene can increase the activity of multiple caspases, including, caspase-3, caspase-9 and caspase-12 in human RPE cells.During ER stress, activated EIF2AK3 phosphorylates EIF2S1, which in turn contributes to the activation of nuclear factor kB (NF-kB), a potent transcriptional factor that regulates angiogenesis and inflammation in proliferative retinal diseases. Increasing levels of inflammatory mediators, such as IL6 and IL8 were been found in the retinas from patients with neovascularisation." EXACT []

