is_a: urn:agi-folder:plasma_membrane ! Plasma membrane
xref: PS:Description "Glucose overload in the lens epithelium leads to the oxidative cell stress. Pathway is built manually using published studies."
synonym: "Description: Glucose overload in the lens epithelium leads to the oxidative cell stress. Pathway is built manually using published studies." EXACT []
