is_a: urn:agi-folder:a ! A
is_a: urn:agi-folder:cataract ! Cataract
is_a: urn:agi-folder:plasma_membrane ! Plasma membrane
xref: PS:Description "Age-related cataract (ARC) is the leading cause of blindness in older individuals. Crystallins are the main cause of the disease. Pathway is built manually using published studies."
synonym: "Description: Age-related cataract (ARC) is the leading cause of blindness in older individuals. Crystallins are the main cause of the disease. Pathway is built manually using published studies." EXACT []
