xref: PS:Notes "Headnote: Asthma is a common long-term lung disorder in which inflammation of the bronchi leads to narrowing of the airways creating breathing difficulties.    Signaling description: Patients with asthma exhibit high levels of IL33 in the serum and lungs. IL33 signaling pathway enhances the expression of CCR3 in dendritic cells (or macrophages and mast cells), which has a central role in facilitating eosinophil mobilization to the inflammatory lung in asthma. IL33 binds to its plasma membrane receptor inducing NFkB and MAPK activation. Outcome effects; IL33 can trigger the production of IL13 from eosinophil, dendritic cells and mast cells. IL33 could be an important driver for CCL17 production by eosinophils, leading to the accumulation of lymphocytes in the airways.    Highlighted proteins: Proteins with increased expression are highlighted in red."
synonym: "Notes: Headnote: Asthma is a common long-term lung disorder in which inflammation of the bronchi leads to narrowing of the airways creating breathing difficulties.    Signaling description: Patients with asthma exhibit high levels of IL33 in the serum and lungs. IL33 signaling pathway enhances the expression of CCR3 in dendritic cells (or macrophages and mast cells), which has a central role in facilitating eosinophil mobilization to the inflammatory lung in asthma. IL33 binds to its plasma membrane receptor inducing NFkB and MAPK activation. Outcome effects; IL33 can trigger the production of IL13 from eosinophil, dendritic cells and mast cells. IL33 could be an important driver for CCL17 production by eosinophils, leading to the accumulation of lymphocytes in the airways.    Highlighted proteins: Proteins with increased expression are highlighted in red." EXACT []

