name: Alveolar Macrophage Negative Regulation Declined in COPD
xref: PS:NodeType "Pathway"
synonym: "NodeType: Pathway" EXACT []
is_a: urn:agi-folder:respiratory_system ! Respiratory system
is_a: urn:agi-folder:a ! A
is_a: urn:agi-folder:chronic_obstructive_pulmonary_disease ! Chronic obstructive pulmonary disease
xref: PS:Description "Normally after the function of alveolar macrophages is complete, they are negatively regulated, mainly by interactions with bronchial and alveolar epithelial cells. Pathway is built manually using published studies."
