xref: PS:Description "Cystic Kidney Disease (CKD) is a group of genetic diseases in which multiple cysts are formed in the kidney. Pathway is built manually using published studies."
synonym: "Description: Cystic Kidney Disease (CKD) is a group of genetic diseases in which multiple cysts are formed in the kidney. Pathway is built manually using published studies." EXACT []
