xref: PS:Notes "The sarcomere this the force-generating structure in cardiomyocytes. The sarcomere is comprised of several proteins, including cardiac actin (encoded by ACTC1), myosin-binding protein C (MYBPC3), myosin heavy chains (MYH6, MYH7), myosin light chains (MYL2)."
