name: IL17 Signaling in Psoriasis
xref: PS:NodeType "Pathway"
synonym: "NodeType: Pathway" EXACT []
is_a: urn:agi-folder:integumentary_system ! Integumentary system
is_a: urn:agi-folder:psoriasis ! Psoriasis
is_a: urn:agi-folder:epidermis ! Epidermis
is_a: urn:agi-folder:i ! I
xref: PS:Description "IL17 signaling activates NF-kB and MAPK pathways through the conserved SEF/IL-17R (SEFIR) domain containing the adaptor protein, Act1 (TRAF3IP2). Pathway is built manually using published studies."
synonym: "Description: IL17 signaling activates NF-kB and MAPK pathways through the conserved SEF/IL-17R (SEFIR) domain containing the adaptor protein, Act1 (TRAF3IP2). Pathway is built manually using published studies." EXACT []
