xref: PS:Description "The differentiation of naive T cells towards a Th17 phenotype is supported by several cytokines including transforming growth factor-B (TGFB1), IL1B, IL6, IL21, and IL23. Pathway is built manually using published studies."
synonym: "Description: The differentiation of naive T cells towards a Th17 phenotype is supported by several cytokines including transforming growth factor-B (TGFB1), IL1B, IL6, IL21, and IL23. Pathway is built manually using published studies." EXACT []
