xref: PS:Notes "Headnote: The endocrine section of the pancreas (islets of Langerhans) consists of insulin-secreting beta-cells and four other endocrine cell types.    Signaling description: ISL1 is a transcription factor that is present in all types of islet cells and can activate insulin, somatostatin, glucagon, and amylin expression. Leptin (LEP) suppresses ISL1 expression and insulin secretion in rodent and human islets in physiological and pathophysiological conditions.    Outcome effects: ISL1 may act as a direct downstream target of the LEP signaling molecule STAT3, but insulin has feedback regulating effects on ISL1 expression through JAK2-STAT3 pathway. LEP may also inhibit insulin secretion by inhibiting PDE3B. ISL1 can synergistically activate insulin (INS) transcription with NEUROD1 in pancreatic beta-cells. LEP has been shown to inhibit insulin secretion by activating PDE3B. In isolated rat islets, IGF1 also directly suppresses insulin secretion most likely mediated through the activation of PDE3B."
synonym: "Notes: Headnote: The endocrine section of the pancreas (islets of Langerhans) consists of insulin-secreting beta-cells and four other endocrine cell types.    Signaling description: ISL1 is a transcription factor that is present in all types of islet cells and can activate insulin, somatostatin, glucagon, and amylin expression. Leptin (LEP) suppresses ISL1 expression and insulin secretion in rodent and human islets in physiological and pathophysiological conditions.    Outcome effects: ISL1 may act as a direct downstream target of the LEP signaling molecule STAT3, but insulin has feedback regulating effects on ISL1 expression through JAK2-STAT3 pathway. LEP may also inhibit insulin secretion by inhibiting PDE3B. ISL1 can synergistically activate insulin (INS) transcription with NEUROD1 in pancreatic beta-cells. LEP has been shown to inhibit insulin secretion by activating PDE3B. In isolated rat islets, IGF1 also directly suppresses insulin secretion most likely mediated through the activation of PDE3B." EXACT []

