name: TGFB2 Signaling Impairement in Osteoarthritis
xref: PS:NodeType "Pathway"
synonym: "NodeType: Pathway" EXACT []
is_a: urn:agi-folder:t ! T
is_a: urn:agi-folder:osteoarthritis ! Osteoarthritis
is_a: urn:agi-folder:skeletal_system ! Skeletal system
xref: PS:Description "The growth factor, TGFB2, which normally strongly inhibits articular chondrocyte hypertrophy and maturation in children. Pathway is built manually using published studies."
