xref: PS:Notes "Headnote: The subfamily of TAM receptors includes AXL, MERTK and TYRO3 receptor protein tyrosine kinases.    Signaling description: GAS6 and PROS1 are well known ligands for TAM receptors. Platelets express all three TAM receptors, AXL, MERTK and TYRO3. Single mice knockouts of AXL, MERTK and TYRO3 have shown that all three receptors are required for normal platelet aggregation.    Outcome effects: The core of TAM receptor signaling through PI3K - PDPK1 - AKT1 leads to alpha2beta3 integrin complex activation and platelet platelet adhesion.    Animal data: Role of TAM receptors for the platelet function was revealed from animal model experiments."
synonym: "Notes: Headnote: The subfamily of TAM receptors includes AXL, MERTK and TYRO3 receptor protein tyrosine kinases.    Signaling description: GAS6 and PROS1 are well known ligands for TAM receptors. Platelets express all three TAM receptors, AXL, MERTK and TYRO3. Single mice knockouts of AXL, MERTK and TYRO3 have shown that all three receptors are required for normal platelet aggregation.    Outcome effects: The core of TAM receptor signaling through PI3K - PDPK1 - AKT1 leads to alpha2beta3 integrin complex activation and platelet platelet adhesion.    Animal data: Role of TAM receptors for the platelet function was revealed from animal model experiments." EXACT []

