xref: PS:Description "The primary physiological function of platelets is to form hemostatic thrombi that prevent blood loss and maintain vascular integrity. Pathway is built manually using published studies."
synonym: "Description: The primary physiological function of platelets is to form hemostatic thrombi that prevent blood loss and maintain vascular integrity. Pathway is built manually using published studies." EXACT []
