xref: PS:Description "Blood vessel sprouting is a process necessary for physiological and pathological angiogenesis. The main signallings involved in sprouting angiogenesis regulation are VEGFA/KDR, DLL4/NOTCH1 and WNT."
synonym: "Description: Blood vessel sprouting is a process necessary for physiological and pathological angiogenesis. The main signallings involved in sprouting angiogenesis regulation are VEGFA/KDR, DLL4/NOTCH1 and WNT." EXACT []
