xref: PS:Notes "Headnote: IL23A, IL6 and TGFB1, produced by antigen-presenting cells, tumor infiltrating macrophages and other myeloid cells in the site of inflammation, are essential for activation of Th17 cells.     Signaling description: IL23A, IL6 and TGFB1 act through their receptors and induce STAT3 activation in Th17 cells. STAT3 is responsible for IL17A expression. In turn, IL17A may act on macrophages, fibroblasts and cancer cells initiating NFkB signaling.     Outcome effects: NFkB induce expression of multiple proteins involved in cancer progression. In addition, TNF, IL6, IL1B, PTGS2, ICAM1 exacerbate inflammation. VEGFA induce vasculogenesis which promotes tumor development. IL17A can be blocked by different monoclonal antibodies (secukinumab, ixekizumab, brodalumab) now being investigated in clinical trials.    Highlighted proteins: Proteins with red highlights have increased expression/activity. See pathway \"Proteins with Altered Expression in Tumor-Promoting Inflammation\" for details.    Mutated proteins: not shown."
synonym: "Notes: Headnote: IL23A, IL6 and TGFB1, produced by antigen-presenting cells, tumor infiltrating macrophages and other myeloid cells in the site of inflammation, are essential for activation of Th17 cells.     Signaling description: IL23A, IL6 and TGFB1 act through their receptors and induce STAT3 activation in Th17 cells. STAT3 is responsible for IL17A expression. In turn, IL17A may act on macrophages, fibroblasts and cancer cells initiating NFkB signaling.     Outcome effects: NFkB induce expression of multiple proteins involved in cancer progression. In addition, TNF, IL6, IL1B, PTGS2, ICAM1 exacerbate inflammation. VEGFA induce vasculogenesis which promotes tumor development. IL17A can be blocked by different monoclonal antibodies (secukinumab, ixekizumab, brodalumab) now being investigated in clinical trials.    Highlighted proteins: Proteins with red highlights have increased expression/activity. See pathway \"Proteins with Altered Expression in Tumor-Promoting Inflammation\" for details.    Mutated proteins: not shown." EXACT []

