name: IL12 Antitumor Effect is Blocked in Cancer
xref: PS:NodeType "Pathway"
synonym: "NodeType: Pathway" EXACT []
is_a: urn:agi-folder:(under_review)_hallmarks_of_cancer_(10)_tumor-promoting_inflammation ! (under review) Hallmarks of cancer (10) tumor-promoting inflammation
