is_a: urn:agi-folder:i ! I
xref: PS:Description "Endogenous IL12 is important for host resistance to tumors. The major antitumor activities of IL12 rely on its ability to promote Th1 adaptive immunity and CTL response. IL12 is often downregulated in cancers."
synonym: "Description: Endogenous IL12 is important for host resistance to tumors. The major antitumor activities of IL12 rely on its ability to promote Th1 adaptive immunity and CTL response. IL12 is often downregulated in cancers." EXACT []
