xref: PS:Notes "Headnote: IL13 is produced by dendritic cells and Th2-cells and may activate it's receptors on the surface of cancer cells.     Signaling description: IL13 acts on the receptor complex which consists of IL13RA1, IL13RA2 and IL4R and activates JAK/STAT6/ZEB1 signaling. ZEB1 controls expression of multiple proteins responsible for epithelial-mesenchymal transition and metastatic progression.    Outcome effects: ZEB1 induces expression of CDH2, VIM, MMP9, FN1, TJP1 and inhibits expression of CDH1 thereby promoting cancer cell invasion and metastatic progression.Anti-IL13 monoclonal antibodies tralokinumab and lebrikizumab and anti-IL4R medicine AMG 317 are being investigated in clinical trials to prove their anti-cancer efficacy.     Animal data: not shown    Highlighted proteins: not shown.    Mutated proteins: not shown."
synonym: "Notes: Headnote: IL13 is produced by dendritic cells and Th2-cells and may activate it's receptors on the surface of cancer cells.     Signaling description: IL13 acts on the receptor complex which consists of IL13RA1, IL13RA2 and IL4R and activates JAK/STAT6/ZEB1 signaling. ZEB1 controls expression of multiple proteins responsible for epithelial-mesenchymal transition and metastatic progression.    Outcome effects: ZEB1 induces expression of CDH2, VIM, MMP9, FN1, TJP1 and inhibits expression of CDH1 thereby promoting cancer cell invasion and metastatic progression.Anti-IL13 monoclonal antibodies tralokinumab and lebrikizumab and anti-IL4R medicine AMG 317 are being investigated in clinical trials to prove their anti-cancer efficacy.     Animal data: not shown    Highlighted proteins: not shown.    Mutated proteins: not shown." EXACT []

