xref: PS:Description "Bone formation is controlled by two major signaling pathways that are induced by TGFB and WNT ligands. Pathway is built manually using published studies."
synonym: "Description: Bone formation is controlled by two major signaling pathways that are induced by TGFB and WNT ligands. Pathway is built manually using published studies." EXACT []
