xref: PS:Description "Insulin is a peptide hormone produced by pancreatic beta-cells located in the islets of Langerhans. Pathway is built manually using published studies."
synonym: "Description: Insulin is a peptide hormone produced by pancreatic beta-cells located in the islets of Langerhans. Pathway is built manually using published studies." EXACT []
