xref: PS:Description "The acute phase response (APR) is a prominent systemic reaction of an organism to infection and tissue injury. Pathway is built manually using published studies."
synonym: "Description: The acute phase response (APR) is a prominent systemic reaction of an organism to infection and tissue injury. Pathway is built manually using published studies." EXACT []
xref: PS:Pathway_Author "A. Nesterova ORCID:0000-0002-9448-8101"
synonym: "Pathway_Author: A. Nesterova ORCID:0000-0002-9448-8101" EXACT []
