is_a: urn:agi-folder:t-cell_activation_and_differentiation ! T-cell activation and differentiation
xref: PS:Description "Th17 are a subset of T-helper cells that primarily produce two main members of the IL17 family, IL17A and IL17F, which are involved in the recruitment, activation, and migration of neutrophils. Pathway is built manually using published studies."
synonym: "Description: Th17 are a subset of T-helper cells that primarily produce two main members of the IL17 family, IL17A and IL17F, which are involved in the recruitment, activation, and migration of neutrophils. Pathway is built manually using published studies." EXACT []
