name: RHO Signaling (Dark)
xref: PS:NodeType "Pathway"
synonym: "NodeType: Pathway" EXACT []
is_a: urn:agi-folder:visual_phototransduction ! Visual phototransduction
is_a: urn:agi-folder:retina ! Retina
is_a: urn:agi-folder:r ! R
is_a: urn:agi-folder:sensory_system ! Sensory system
xref: PS:Description "Phototransduction is the process of converting light into electrical neural signals which takes place in the outer segments of photoreceptors. Pathway is built manually using published studies."
synonym: "Description: Phototransduction is the process of converting light into electrical neural signals which takes place in the outer segments of photoreceptors. Pathway is built manually using published studies." EXACT []
