xref: PS:Description "Physiological responses to stressors such as inflammation are primarily mediated by two neuroendocrine systems: sympathetic nervous system (SNS) and hypothalamic-pituitary-adrenal (HPA) axis. Pathway is built manually using published studies."
synonym: "Description: Physiological responses to stressors such as inflammation are primarily mediated by two neuroendocrine systems: sympathetic nervous system (SNS) and hypothalamic-pituitary-adrenal (HPA) axis. Pathway is built manually using published studies." EXACT []
