xref: PS:Organ_System "generic"
synonym: "Organ_System: generic" EXACT []
xref: PS:Tissue "generic"
synonym: "Tissue: generic" EXACT []
xref: PS:Organ "generic"
synonym: "Organ: generic" EXACT []
xref: PS:Source "Biological Process"
synonym: "Source: Biological Process" EXACT []
xref: PS:Notes "Headnote: The mannose receptor (MRC1) is a recognition receptor for pathogen-associated molecular patterns (PAMPs), which are small molecular motifs found on pathogens. It is present on the surface of macrophages and dendritic cells.    Signaling description: MRC1 recognizes and binds to carbohydrates on the surface of pathogens and its activation triggers endocytosis and phagocytosis of the microbe. MRC1 belongs to the multilectin receptor protein group and like TLRs provides a link between innate and adaptive immunity."
synonym: "Notes: Headnote: The mannose receptor (MRC1) is a recognition receptor for pathogen-associated molecular patterns (PAMPs), which are small molecular motifs found on pathogens. It is present on the surface of macrophages and dendritic cells.    Signaling description: MRC1 recognizes and binds to carbohydrates on the surface of pathogens and its activation triggers endocytosis and phagocytosis of the microbe. MRC1 belongs to the multilectin receptor protein group and like TLRs provides a link between innate and adaptive immunity." EXACT []

