xref: PS:Source "Atlas"
synonym: "Source: Atlas" EXACT []
xref: PS:Notes "IL-17 and IL-22 promote the proliferation of keratinocytes, a key sign  of psoriasis. Keratinocytes synthesize a wide range of proinflammatory  cytokines, which attract neutrophils, activate dendritic cells, and maintain  the inflammatory reaction in the skin.    Entitiy with increased expression or activity is highlighted in red. Entity with low activity is highlighted in blue. Mutated genes are shown in white-out style. Viral proteins are grey."
synonym: "Notes: IL-17 and IL-22 promote the proliferation of keratinocytes, a key sign  of psoriasis. Keratinocytes synthesize a wide range of proinflammatory  cytokines, which attract neutrophils, activate dendritic cells, and maintain  the inflammatory reaction in the skin.    Entitiy with increased expression or activity is highlighted in red. Entity with low activity is highlighted in blue. Mutated genes are shown in white-out style. Viral proteins are grey." EXACT []

[Term]
id: urn:agi-pathway:uuid-70ffda9b-ce38-4486-ba2b-39195987ae09
name: 1_Ichthyosis vulgaris overview
xref: PS:NodeType "Pathway"
synonym: "NodeType: Pathway" EXACT []
is_a: urn:agi-folder:1 ! 1
is_a: urn:agi-folder:ichthyosis ! Ichthyosis
xref: PS:Description "published in: Disease Pathways: An Atlas of Human Disease Pathways, 2019 https://www.elsevier.com/books/disease-pathways/nesterova/978-0-12-817086-1"
synonym: "Description: published in: Disease Pathways: An Atlas of Human Disease Pathways, 2019 https://www.elsevier.com/books/disease-pathways/nesterova/978-0-12-817086-1" EXACT []
