xref: PS:Notes "TGFB signaling is the primary stimulator of terminal chondrocyte  differentiation.  Mutations in genes that encode proteins involved with the TGFB-related  cascades have strong associations with OA development in some populations.  Overexpression of MMP13, COL10A1, BGLAP, SPP1, and SPARC by  chondrocytes in patients with OA provokes endochondral ossification  and disease progression.    Entitiy with increased expression or activity is highlighted in red. Entity with low activity is highlighted in blue. Mutated genes are shown in white-out style. Viral proteins are grey."
synonym: "Notes: TGFB signaling is the primary stimulator of terminal chondrocyte  differentiation.  Mutations in genes that encode proteins involved with the TGFB-related  cascades have strong associations with OA development in some populations.  Overexpression of MMP13, COL10A1, BGLAP, SPP1, and SPARC by  chondrocytes in patients with OA provokes endochondral ossification  and disease progression.    Entitiy with increased expression or activity is highlighted in red. Entity with low activity is highlighted in blue. Mutated genes are shown in white-out style. Viral proteins are grey." EXACT []

