xref: PS:Notes "Low expression of pattern recognition receptors leads to insufficient immune  response in the middle ear epithelium cells in otitis media. The downregulation of TLRs, NODs, and other pattern recognition  receptor expression in otitis media leads to an inefficient defense in  the middle ear, which in turn causes repeated infections and persistent  inflammations.    Entitiy with increased expression or activity is highlighted in red. Entity with low activity is highlighted in blue. Mutated genes are shown in white-out style. Viral proteins are grey."
synonym: "Notes: Low expression of pattern recognition receptors leads to insufficient immune  response in the middle ear epithelium cells in otitis media. The downregulation of TLRs, NODs, and other pattern recognition  receptor expression in otitis media leads to an inefficient defense in  the middle ear, which in turn causes repeated infections and persistent  inflammations.    Entitiy with increased expression or activity is highlighted in red. Entity with low activity is highlighted in blue. Mutated genes are shown in white-out style. Viral proteins are grey." EXACT []

