synonym: "Organ_System: respiratory system" EXACT []
xref: PS:Source "Atlas"
synonym: "Source: Atlas" EXACT []
xref: PS:Notes "Cigarette smoke, air pollutants, and inflammation may induce self-autophagy  and apoptosis of alveolar epithelial cells.  Loss of alveolar epithelial cells either by apoptosis or by self-autophagy  is one of the significant factors in the development of pulmonary emphysema  (i.e., the loss of lung parenchyma with the concomitant enlargement  of air spaces), a prominent hallmark of COPD.    Entitiy with increased expression or activity is highlighted in red. Entity with low activity is highlighted in blue. Mutated genes are shown in white-out style. Viral proteins are grey."
synonym: "Notes: Cigarette smoke, air pollutants, and inflammation may induce self-autophagy  and apoptosis of alveolar epithelial cells.  Loss of alveolar epithelial cells either by apoptosis or by self-autophagy  is one of the significant factors in the development of pulmonary emphysema  (i.e., the loss of lung parenchyma with the concomitant enlargement  of air spaces), a prominent hallmark of COPD.    Entitiy with increased expression or activity is highlighted in red. Entity with low activity is highlighted in blue. Mutated genes are shown in white-out style. Viral proteins are grey." EXACT []

