xref: PS:Notes "Airway neutrophilia is one of the hallmarks  of severe asthma. Neutrophils, the largest class of white blood cells,  are major cellular antibacterial agents in inflammation since they combine  the functions of granulocytes and phagocytes. Neutrophilia in asthma is  associated with severe asthma and persistent steroid resistance.    Entitiy with increased expression or activity is highlighted in red. Entity with low activity is highlighted in blue. Mutated genes are shown in white-out style. Viral proteins are grey."
synonym: "Notes: Airway neutrophilia is one of the hallmarks  of severe asthma. Neutrophils, the largest class of white blood cells,  are major cellular antibacterial agents in inflammation since they combine  the functions of granulocytes and phagocytes. Neutrophilia in asthma is  associated with severe asthma and persistent steroid resistance.    Entitiy with increased expression or activity is highlighted in red. Entity with low activity is highlighted in blue. Mutated genes are shown in white-out style. Viral proteins are grey." EXACT []

