synonym: "PathwayType: signaling" EXACT []
xref: PS:Source "Atlas"
synonym: "Source: Atlas" EXACT []
xref: PS:Notes "Patients with COPD, similarly to patients with asthma, have increased  luminal mucus secretion (see Asthma). Mucin hypersecretion is strengthened  especially with age and with chronic respiratory tract infections.  Excessive mucus production and impaired mucociliary clearance cause  airway obstruction and facilitate the spread of respiratory infections in  patients with COPD.    Entitiy with increased expression or activity is highlighted in red. Entity with low activity is highlighted in blue. Mutated genes are shown in white-out style. Viral proteins are grey."
synonym: "Notes: Patients with COPD, similarly to patients with asthma, have increased  luminal mucus secretion (see Asthma). Mucin hypersecretion is strengthened  especially with age and with chronic respiratory tract infections.  Excessive mucus production and impaired mucociliary clearance cause  airway obstruction and facilitate the spread of respiratory infections in  patients with COPD.    Entitiy with increased expression or activity is highlighted in red. Entity with low activity is highlighted in blue. Mutated genes are shown in white-out style. Viral proteins are grey." EXACT []

