xref: PS:Source "Atlas"
synonym: "Source: Atlas" EXACT []
xref: PS:Notes "Failed autophagy and a decline in the synthesis of defensins by  antigen-presenting cells and Paneth cells are thought to lead to high levels  of bacterial penetration to intestine tissue. Entry of pathogenic organisms  or their component parts into the lamina propria and the migration of  antigen-presenting cells to Peyer’s patches with antigens then stimulate  the T-helper cell response and Crohn’s-like inflammation in the intestine    Entitiy with increased expression or activity is highlighted in red. Entity with low activity is highlighted in blue. Mutated genes are shown in white-out style. Viral proteins are grey."
synonym: "Notes: Failed autophagy and a decline in the synthesis of defensins by  antigen-presenting cells and Paneth cells are thought to lead to high levels  of bacterial penetration to intestine tissue. Entry of pathogenic organisms  or their component parts into the lamina propria and the migration of  antigen-presenting cells to Peyer’s patches with antigens then stimulate  the T-helper cell response and Crohn’s-like inflammation in the intestine    Entitiy with increased expression or activity is highlighted in red. Entity with low activity is highlighted in blue. Mutated genes are shown in white-out style. Viral proteins are grey." EXACT []

