xref: PS:Notes "Ulcerative colitis initiates with the disruption of the epithelial barrier of  the rectum and colon resulting in increased uptake of luminal microbiota  and antigens. Dysfunction of intestine epithelial cells reduces the defense  abilities of the mucosal layer and causes a loss of mucosal tolerance to  luminal pathogens.    Entitiy with increased expression or activity is highlighted in red. Entity with low activity is highlighted in blue. Mutated genes are shown in white-out style. Viral proteins are grey."
