synonym: "PathwayType: signaling" EXACT []
xref: PS:Source "Atlas"
synonym: "Source: Atlas" EXACT []
xref: PS:Notes "The HTLV-1–encoded tax protein can modify NF-kB signaling by interacting  with many mitogen-activated protein kinase kinase kinase (MAP3K  proteins) and direct interactions with one of the NF-kB signaling pathway  proteins—inhibitor of kappa-light polypeptide gene enhancer in B-cells,  kinase gamma (IKBKG). NF-kB signaling in CD4+ T cells is necessary for their survival.  Interfering with its regulation blocks apoptosis and promotes cell survival.    Entitiy with increased expression or activity is highlighted in red. Entity with low activity is highlighted in blue. Mutated genes are shown in white-out style. Viral proteins are grey."
synonym: "Notes: The HTLV-1–encoded tax protein can modify NF-kB signaling by interacting  with many mitogen-activated protein kinase kinase kinase (MAP3K  proteins) and direct interactions with one of the NF-kB signaling pathway  proteins—inhibitor of kappa-light polypeptide gene enhancer in B-cells,  kinase gamma (IKBKG). NF-kB signaling in CD4+ T cells is necessary for their survival.  Interfering with its regulation blocks apoptosis and promotes cell survival.    Entitiy with increased expression or activity is highlighted in red. Entity with low activity is highlighted in blue. Mutated genes are shown in white-out style. Viral proteins are grey." EXACT []

