name: 6_p12I Viral protein promotes T-cell activation in HTLV-1 infection
xref: PS:NodeType "Pathway"
synonym: "NodeType: Pathway" EXACT []
is_a: urn:agi-folder:6 ! 6
is_a: urn:agi-folder:human_t-cell_leukemia_virus_infection ! Human T-cell leukemia virus infection
xref: PS:Description "published in: Disease Pathways: An Atlas of Human Disease Pathways, 2019 https://www.elsevier.com/books/disease-pathways/nesterova/978-0-12-817086-1"
