xref: PS:Notes "The excess levels of triglycerides in adipose tissue caused by a highfat  diet provoke local inflammation. However, the precise molecular  mechanism underlying this phenomenon remains elusive.  Pathway 4. Insulin resistance:  Inflammation-related insulin resistance (Fig. 8).    Entitiy with increased expression or activity is highlighted in red. Entity with low activity is highlighted in blue. Mutated genes are shown in white-out style. Viral proteins are grey."
