synonym: "Link: https://mammal-profservices.pathwaystudio.com/app/sd?urn=urn:agi-pathway:uuid-b324081c-10fa-45ae-8dd5-e7e6e13f8ff5" EXACT []
xref: PS:PathwayType "signaling"
synonym: "PathwayType: signaling" EXACT []
xref: PS:Source "Atlas"
synonym: "Source: Atlas" EXACT []
xref: PS:Notes "In early diabetes, progressive beta-cell dysfunction and apoptosis induced  by the action of autoantibodies and of cytotoxic T-cell attack cause  metabolic abnormalities including the disruption of insulin secretion and  glucose metabolism.  During the activation of the cell-mediated immune response, islet beta  cells stop producing insulin and undergo apoptosis and pancreatic tissue  becomes inflamed. Continued inflammation triggers further beta-cell  dysfunction.    Entitiy with increased expression or activity is highlighted in red. Entity with low activity is highlighted in blue. Mutated genes are shown in white-out style. Viral proteins are grey."
synonym: "Notes: In early diabetes, progressive beta-cell dysfunction and apoptosis induced  by the action of autoantibodies and of cytotoxic T-cell attack cause  metabolic abnormalities including the disruption of insulin secretion and  glucose metabolism.  During the activation of the cell-mediated immune response, islet beta  cells stop producing insulin and undergo apoptosis and pancreatic tissue  becomes inflamed. Continued inflammation triggers further beta-cell  dysfunction.    Entitiy with increased expression or activity is highlighted in red. Entity with low activity is highlighted in blue. Mutated genes are shown in white-out style. Viral proteins are grey." EXACT []

